      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CABERNET CARTEL (3) started big odds in far stiffer grade latest when finishing 6th over 350m at this track. Scored at this track in weaker company the previous run. Has ability and looks hard to stop. GYPSY MOSS (1) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten half a length (19.22) behind CABERNET CARTEL at this track. The form out of her last race has been franked. Must be included in calculations. LUNAR LIL (7) hit the ground running and was prominent throughout but faded out of it when 7th at this track in a Grade 5. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. One of the main contenders. SASSY SIREN (4) can sneak into the finish.",
